#TRF_station = trade station
#TRF_stnamb1 = Another freighter overdue on the Debris lanes. FTU says nothing.
#TRF_stnamb2 = Half our berths are military charters since the war opened.
#TRF_stnamb3 = Border crews talk about berserk skirmishes again.
#TRF_stncredit = Docking on credit. The harbour will remember.
#TRF_stndepot = Depot control. The lanes are not safe, we sealed the bays. Try the trade station.
#TRF_stnevbarge = Dockmaster: an ore barge is inbound with pirates on its tail. Cover it to the station and the harbour pays.
#TRF_stnevfar = Dockmaster: they made it, but not with your help. No pay.
#TRF_stnevlaunch = Dockmaster: a refugee launch is adrift near the gate. Bring it in to the station and the harbour pays.
#TRF_stnevlost = Dockmaster: we lost them.
#TRF_stnevmet = Launch: thank you, Wolves! We follow you to the station.
#TRF_stnevok = Dockmaster: they are in. credits for your trouble, Wolves.
#TRF_stnevshuttle = Dockmaster: a tanker shuttle is inbound. Escort it to the station and the harbour pays.
#TRF_stnfeehub = Heavy traffic surcharge: credits.
#TRF_stnfeepen = Penalty docking fee: credits.
#TRF_stnfeereq = Initiate docking?
#TRF_stnmlkfni = New Empire administration. Martial law in this system. All docking suspended.
#TRF_stnmluss = USS security. Station locked down until the sweep is over.
#TRF_stnnews = Harbour news
#TRF_stnnoted = Dockmaster: noted, Wolves.
#TRF_stnpaid = Docking fee paid: credits.
#TRF_stnpirdead = (only static on the channel)
#TRF_stnpirheat = Ha, the Wolves! Nice work on the lanes. Still closed, but the boys say hello.
#TRF_stnr1 = Welcome back, Wolves. Berth four is free.
#TRF_stnr2 = Wolves, good to see you again. The harbour hears things
#TRF_stnr3 = No surcharge for you, captain. Harbour news follows.
#TRF_stnr4 = A word between us, Wolves
#TRF_stnr5 = Clear the lane, the Wolves are coming in! Dock three is yours.
#TRF_stnrm1 = Dock if you must. Security has your berth on camera.
#TRF_stnrm2 = We hear what you do on the lanes. Docking costs you double.
#TRF_stnrm3 = Wolves? Your account here is closed. Pay the penalty or fly on.
#TRF_stntipbase = The pirates have a base in. Everybody knows, nobody goes.
#TRF_stntipfeq = A navy supply run is due at.
#TRF_stntiprob = You used our word to rob the navy.
#TRF_stntipsweep = is gathering a fleet against the. Stay off the lanes for a while.
#TRF_svfull = No room for more survivors.
#TRF_svloss = Distress beacon: FTU freighter lost. Escape pods transmitting.
#TRF_svlost = The survivors were transferred to a passing FTU patrol.
#TRF_svnear = anyone on this channel... FTU crew, a few of us left... air for a few hours...
#TRF_svpaid = Survivors handed over to FTU. credits transferred.
#TRF_svpick = Survivor aboard.
#TRF_svpickall = All survivors aboard. Any FTU station will take them.
#TRF_svrumlost = A transport was lost near. The crew was never found.
#TRF_svrumsaved = The Wolves pulled a crew out of.
#TRF_svrumtaken = Pirates picked up a freighter crew near. Nobody will see them again.
#TRF_svseed = FTU relay: a freighter went silent here. Its distress beacon is still transmitting.
#TRF_svsilent = The beacon in this system has gone silent.
#TRF_svthanks1 = Their families had stopped hoping. FTU will not forget this, Wolves.
#TRF_svthanks2 = FTU takes the crew off your hands. The medics are already waiting.
#TRF_svthanks3 = Another crew home alive. The lanes owe you one, Wolves.
#TRF_svthanksw = FTU logs the rescue. The crew will remember who came for them.
#TRF_swfac = fleet engaging the.
#TRF_thanks = FTU: Thank you, Wolves. We owe you.
#TRF_trhead = Raids reported
#TRF_tritem = FTU
#TRF_trnone = Lanes are quiet within three jumps.
#TRF_unknown = unknown space
#TRF_who = FTU
#TRF_whononame = FTU

